From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bitpony <bitpony@example.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 20:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8189fs: disable SDIO power saving

Disable the Realtek IPS/LPS power-saving paths for Rockbase. Field
freeze logs showed RTL8189FS SDIO threads stuck around the command and
transmit paths while the system was under storage pressure; keeping the
WiFi device out of IPS/LPS removes the low-power SDIO transition path
from the runtime test image.

Signed-off-by: bitpony <bitpony@example.com>
---
 Makefile | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 3e4e8b8..0c4b0aa 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -54,9 +54,9 @@ CONFIG_SDIO_HCI = y
 CONFIG_GSPI_HCI = n
 ########################## Features ###########################
 CONFIG_MP_INCLUDED = y
-CONFIG_POWER_SAVING = y
-CONFIG_IPS_MODE = default
-CONFIG_LPS_MODE = default
+CONFIG_POWER_SAVING = n
+CONFIG_IPS_MODE = 0
+CONFIG_LPS_MODE = 0
 CONFIG_USB_AUTOSUSPEND = n
 CONFIG_HW_PWRP_DETECTION = n
 CONFIG_BT_COEXIST = n
-- 
2.34.1

